    "toast.tip.breaker" : {
      "comment" : "Toast in the right column (uppercased; wraps, two lines at most). First time a dark light circuit's breaker is near the player: standing 6 s in its ring brings the deck's lamps back; nothing drops from the overhead onto lit deck. Amber edge. Max width: 596 pt.",
